{"3774530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YATTY - Dice Card Battle -", "steam_appid": 3774530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 “Dice × Cards” — One Roll Can Change Everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new card battle game <strong>YATTY</strong> is here — now with <strong>Tutorial</strong>, <strong>CPU Battle</strong>, and <strong>Create Mode</strong> for even more freedom and accessibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your copy today and experience the all-new, evolved <strong>YATTY</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Skill Doesn’t Matter! It’s a Battle of Luck and Strategy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns rolling four dice to complete the hands shown on their cards.<br>If you hit the right combination — it’s your big chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you deal massive damage to your opponent, or draw cards to prepare for the next counterattack?<br>The choice — and the strategy — is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use attack, defense, and support cards, and master the <strong>keep &amp; re-roll system</strong> to outplay your rivals!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Fun for Everyone — Up to 4 Players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with up to <strong>four players</strong>!<br>With three or more, attacks fly in both directions, making the action faster and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the late game, unexpected events occur — like using the previous player’s dice — turning the tides in an instant.<br>Even if you’re defeated, it’s not over yet…<br>Come back as a <strong>Ghost</strong> and take revenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻 Don’t Give Up Until the Very End — Ghost Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game keeps you on edge until the final roll.<br>Even if you’re knocked out, there’s still a <strong>chance to return</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you roll all matching dice in one throw…<br>A <strong>miraculous comeback victory</strong> might be waiting for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Create Your Own Original Card Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Create Mode</strong>, you can customize every element of YATTY —<br>from basic rules like HP and hand size, to the effects of each card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even <strong>replace card illustrations</strong> with your own images<br>to craft a completely original version of YATTY and share it with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and make the ultimate card battle experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Turn Luck Into Power — And Claim Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“What!? A comeback here!?”<br>“No way, that luck is insane!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments like these will have everyone shouting —<br>because in <strong>YATTY</strong>, no one knows who will win until the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of <strong>one roll that can change everything!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 “Dice × Cards” — One Roll Can Change Everything!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new card battle game <strong>YATTY</strong> is here — now with <strong>Tutorial</strong>, <strong>CPU Battle</strong>, and <strong>Create Mode</strong> for even more freedom and accessibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your copy today and experience the all-new, evolved <strong>YATTY</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Skill Doesn’t Matter! It’s a Battle of Luck and Strategy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns rolling four dice to complete the hands shown on their cards.<br>If you hit the right combination — it’s your big chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you deal massive damage to your opponent, or draw cards to prepare for the next counterattack?<br>The choice — and the strategy — is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use attack, defense, and support cards, and master the <strong>keep &amp; re-roll system</strong> to outplay your rivals!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Fun for Everyone — Up to 4 Players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with up to <strong>four players</strong>!<br>With three or more, attacks fly in both directions, making the action faster and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the late game, unexpected events occur — like using the previous player’s dice — turning the tides in an instant.<br>Even if you’re defeated, it’s not over yet…<br>Come back as a <strong>Ghost</strong> and take revenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👻 Don’t Give Up Until the Very End — Ghost Mode!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game keeps you on edge until the final roll.<br>Even if you’re knocked out, there’s still a <strong>chance to return</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you roll all matching dice in one throw…<br>A <strong>miraculous comeback victory</strong> might be waiting for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Create Your Own Original Card Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Create Mode</strong>, you can customize every element of YATTY —<br>from basic rules like HP and hand size, to the effects of each card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even <strong>replace card illustrations</strong> with your own images<br>to craft a completely original version of YATTY and share it with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and make the ultimate card battle experience!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Turn Luck Into Power — And Claim Victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“What!? A comeback here!?”<br>“No way, that luck is insane!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moments like these will have everyone shouting —<br>because in <strong>YATTY</strong>, no one knows who will win until the very end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of <strong>one roll that can change everything!</strong></p>", "short_description": "🎲 “Dice × Cards” — One Roll Can Change Everything! Battle, customize